	(text "System-5 IO panel card, Rev A (2026): the front panel on the 36-pin bus (docs/manual/bus.md, the 36-pin extension). Design notes: ../DESIGN.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c1aee259-e648-5348-9572-3cb36e1981b1"))
	(text "Port 4 (U1 74HCT138 on N0-N2): OUT 4 latches the byte in U2 (74HCT374, on TPB's fall) for eight LEDs and two TIL311s; INP 4 reads the eight toggles SW1-SW8 through U3 (74HCT244)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c09e8b9c-906b-58fc-b682-4fda5599f545"))
	(text "INPUT (SW9, debounced) on -EF1. ELF-style RUN/RESET (SW10, -RESET) and LOAD (SW11, -PAUSE) toggles; in LOAD mode each INPUT press is one DMA IN (U10: REQ, ACK) with the switches as the data." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "02f75625-fb91-5dd0-9dc7-940fa72d2728"))
